{"id":14922,"slug":"festival-retro-maullin-2027-ya-esta-en-analisis-de-la-comision-provincial-llanquihue","title":"FESTIVAL RETRO MAULLÍN 2027 YA ESTÁ EN ANÁLISIS DE LA COMISIÓN PROVINCIAL LLANQUIHUE","date":"2026-09-23T02:29:18","excerpt":"Durante la jornada de este lunes, la Comisión Provincial Llanquihue del Consejo Regional de Los Lagos analizó diversas iniciativas de interés para las comunas de la provincia. Entre ellas se encuentra el proyecto correspondiente al XXVII Festival de Canto Retro Maullín 2027, tradicional evento cultural de nuestra comuna que busca avanzar en su proceso de […]","categories":[{"id":179,"name":"Agrupaciones Comunitarias","slug":"agrupaciones-comunitarias"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":370,"name":"Desarrollo social y comunitario","slug":"desarrollo-social-y-comunitario"},{"id":510,"name":"Festival Retro","slug":"festival-retro"},{"id":11,"name":"Fomento","slug":"fomento"},{"id":33,"name":"Innovación","slug":"innovacion"},{"id":1,"name":"Proyectos","slug":"proyectos"},{"id":34,"name":"Regional","slug":"regional"},{"id":15,"name":"Turismo","slug":"turismo"},{"id":916,"name":"VERANO","slug":"verano"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/14922.webp","content":"<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14941\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903-1024x682.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903-767x511.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_5903.jpg 1772w\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durante la jornada de este lunes, la Comisión Provincial Llanquihue del Consejo Regional de Los Lagos analizó diversas iniciativas de interés para las comunas de la provincia.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Entre ellas se encuentra el proyecto correspondiente al XXVII Festival de Canto Retro Maullín 2027, tradicional evento cultural de nuestra comuna que busca avanzar en su proceso de evaluación.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La sesión también contempló la presentación de otras iniciativas y requerimientos de municipios y organizaciones de la provincia.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🎤\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7e/1/16/1f3a4.png\"/><img alt=\"🎼\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcc/1/16/1f3bc.png\"/> Maullín continúa trabajando para proyectar una nueva versión de su tradicional Festival Retro.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/maull%C3%ADn?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Maullín</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/festivalretro?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#FestivalRetro</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/cultura?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#Cultura</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/coreloslagos?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#CORELosLagos</a><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/provinciadellanquihue?__cft__[0]=AZip21EW9jccjkDc88wuhRlkhLwyErxzvHd6Px8ix-ZWDJ-n6nHvmJP1pvfB_-7InMa7FGG_d6IZat6-sf41R2lD3Wig76Bvkd48_LjAvxthlfPJH2XP1zLUTueX5bHNoXZafddIkkw&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">#ProvinciaDeLlanquihue</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14925\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552-1024x678.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552-1024x678.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552-300x198.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552-767x508.jpg 767w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552-1536x1017.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0552.jpg 1654w\"/></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-31 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14924\" data-id=\"14924\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/DSC_0481-1024